    <bpmn:process id="W_W3575" name="W3575. Architecture Repository, Documentation &amp; Knowledge Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: EA artifacts produced/updated (W3569–W3574); ARB cycle
Frequency: Continuous + per artifact
Volume: Enterprise architecture knowledge base
Owner: Enterprise Architects
Participants: Enterprise Architects, Domain Architects, IT Operations (links to VS-27), ITAM (links to VS-99), Data Office (links to VS-28.2), Records (links to VS-88)
Source: workflow W3575 — Architecture Repository, Documentation &amp; Knowledge Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3575_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3575_Lane1" name="Enterprise Architects">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3575_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3575_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3575_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3575_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3575_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3575_Start3" name="EA artifacts produced/updated (W3569–W3574); ARB cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3575_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3575_Task4" name="Enterprise Architects maintain the EA repository: principles (W3570), reference…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Enterprise Architects maintain the EA repository: principles (W3570), reference architectures (W3570), standards/ATL (W3572), solution-architecture artifacts (W3571), waivers (W3573), the application portfolio (W3577), integration inventory (W3579), data architecture (W3581), and technology roadmap (W3585); structure by capability/domain
Responsible (R): Enterprise Architects
Accountable (A): Chief Enterprise Architect
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3575_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3575_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3575_Task5" name="Enterprise Architects/ITAM maintain the enterprise capability map and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Enterprise Architects/ITAM maintain the enterprise capability map and application-to-capability mapping (which applications serve which business capabilities), the application inventory and ownership, and the integration/dependency map (links to W3577/W3579); reconcile to discovery (links to VS-99/VS-27.2) and CMDB
Responsible (R): Enterprise Architects / ITAM
Accountable (A): Chief Enterprise Architect
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3575_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3575_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3575_Task6" name="Enterprise Architects/Records govern the repository: version control…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Enterprise Architects/Records govern the repository: version control, access/security (links to VS-27.3), retention (links to VS-88), and publish/consume patterns (self-service for projects); integrate to the PMO (links to VS-112) and audit evidence (links to VS-21)
Responsible (R): Enterprise Architects / Records
Accountable (A): Chief Enterprise Architect
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3575_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3575_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3575_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3575_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
