        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-568 (ensure controlled execution — Enterprise Architecture Framework, Standards &amp; Governance (PA-113.1).) | - operational: currency SLAs and ARB tie-in; operational: structured repository and API
Owner: Enterprise Architects</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
